{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"27552f5eb085d5a274d3944d9786a07c868dbdaca536f33ce203111fdd82739b","ja":"ふたりの捜査","zh":"两人的侦查","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4d40e6331ef37ccc1afd24a4898ab6505d9708bbae62de10cd33d8517576f6ff","ja":"ふたりは、順調にゲームを進めて……","zh":"两人顺利地推进着游戏……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d1027234850f2ba2f94aaa7b792bf9533cf7f4388b739fb589531b3e08e47add","ja":"ここが第3の事件現場なんだね……。","zh":"这里就是第3起事件的现场啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"358c665e4fde50598a6a7ff05f6bd2ea5c69e362aa065b2ad22350bbce09cf4e","ja":"わっ！？　ムービーの途中でボタンを押すの！？\nこんなのあるんだ！？","zh":"哇！？要在影片播放过程中按按钮吗！？\n居然还有这种操作！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b44d4e0ff837d21c838a56cff93bac09bd4ccdfcb2eb67cf1ab556de0ec6a182","ja":"QTEってやつだね！\n大丈夫、あるってわかってれば対応できるよ！","zh":"就是所谓的QTE吧！\n没关系，只要知道有这个，就能应对！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"10b360ae01abb65fa794fee952816357d0e0d3b4f1c8ffebc66eaa8cca8963e0","ja":"わぁ～！　パーフェクト！\n杏奈すごい！　天才！","zh":"哇～！完美！\n杏奈好厉害！天才！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"91b75bb39121f9c6919c2e619bcb075b1ec8bbed4143649a091c87a952cd2ca9","ja":"えへへ……♪\nさあ、どんどんストーリー進めていこ！","zh":"嘿嘿……♪\n来吧，继续推进剧情吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"79cca31e5df26212fee2cdde3da4683cb1904d0e33d991d09a2e73de9bc99a4c","ja":"さあ、ついにクライマックス！\n推理パートだよ！　未来は誰が犯人かわかった？","zh":"来吧，终于到高潮部分了！\n推理环节哦！未来，你知道犯人是谁了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6d7134cc4f1fe4a632c10e246c653de0492cf225894e9204fd791f826fed3fcc","ja":"この中に犯人がいるの！？\nほんとに！？　全然わかんないよ～！","zh":"这里面有犯人！？\n真的吗！？我完全看不出来呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"63ab59798ed87929447cee188cd86671af7c183700947badaaeeb9a0aba3a15d","ja":"ここで大事なのが、集めた証言と証拠だよ。\nまずは今までのものを、順番に確認してみて。","zh":"这里重要的是收集到的证词和证据。\n先按顺序确认一下目前为止收集到的东西吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e4424ee18cb43351fec5526d984ba753b1f75e5f36195ca6df6a2d6f9061ae82","ja":"う、うん。えーっと……この人はアリバイがあって、\nこの人は、ケガしてて犯行は無理で……。","zh":"嗯、嗯。那个……这个人有不在场证明，\n这个人受了伤，没法作案……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5c0357037e42fcbb9a31d63b7a1f8d867c9c9119104dcdbd3a82ebebc2bdd63b","ja":"えーっ！　この証言と証拠だと、\n犯人は、最初に殺された人ってことーっ！！","zh":"诶——！按照这份证词和证据来看，犯人就是第一个被杀的人——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d242a83e9f128e61e39b264836e1cdb0f1435a6a7019f3ac3445e24b649b7b61","ja":"「証拠と証言全部、そのまま受け取ってて草」\n「未来ちゃん純粋で可愛いね～」「推理がんばれ！」","zh":"「把所有证据和证言都照单全收了，笑死」\n「未来真是单纯又可爱啊～」「推理加油！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3397e9e6df0be468774b29dac355e8e0788dabf6ab85647992f622326d910f9d","ja":"落ち着いて、未来。こういうのは、証言に\n矛盾があったり、嘘を暴くヒントが隠れてるんだよ。","zh":"冷静点，未来。这种时候，证词里往往会有矛盾，或者隐藏着揭穿谎言的线索。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"f44c2d3a670fa9d0cc4930b885d1364bac2e3620ee76bcde3aee6d1f9d08d14c","ja":"たとえば……ほら、誰かの証言と、\nこの証拠品、変じゃない？","zh":"比如……你看，某人的证言和这件证物，不觉得很奇怪吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"70808d2aaea0343ec9b9cb2eacf17c3ebb29bf153b46c523524ad8a95a08f705","ja":"あ、このワンピースの子の証言、\n証拠と合ってない……。","zh":"啊，这个穿连衣裙的孩子的证言，和证据对不上……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"80506ea050c7efbe22303b4963d68d44cd655484c5795bd33396431da0ceb226","ja":"じゃあ、この子が犯人なの！？\nこんなすごい事件を起こす子には見えないのに！","zh":"那么，这孩子就是犯人吗！？\n明明看起来不像会引发这么严重事件的人！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"4273162d534e9252c0d862f740ddec60b862a3e3bd5722c1402af91d12e8d763","ja":"そういう人ほど、犯人だったりするんだよ。\n推理ものあるあるだね！","zh":"越是那种人，往往越是犯人呢。\n这可是推理作品里的经典套路！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"6f0ddf9700237d1cc4e5765c6536968eb90bad15e7b25f0502ff83666726eb0b","ja":"でもでも、こんなに怯えてるし！\n本当にこの子が犯人なのかな～？","zh":"可是可是，它都已经害怕成这样了！\n这孩子真的是犯人吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"4f6a3f27ccc4af27ab37153373d35f0712db1f29bc160443380b72e8eb3b98fe","ja":"今のところ、一番怪しいのは間違いないよ。","zh":"目前最可疑的，毫无疑问就是这个。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"cf33f6b248bce54dca78778959747c072d3909a5a40e9cedc57b6be7818b8801","ja":"わわ、コメントもみんな杏奈と同じ意見だ！\nそれなら、本当に犯人なのかな……？","zh":"哇，评论也都和杏奈的意见一样！\n这样的话，她真的就是犯人吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1802.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"8a503f49cdcef3ff4afa7e673ae304e2475e41788a5f16fad96bd410228b7be7","ja":"よーし、答え合わせのためにも、\n推理パートを進めていくよー！","zh":"好——为了核对答案，\n继续推进推理环节吧——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
